Scene spec fixtures
-------------------

Copied unchanged from allboa/scenespec at commit
898419b1489306bc3f68dbc9a424280d176b1db0 (main after scenespec#13, "Write
down the explicit-data contract"). Each scene keeps its files at the same
paths relative to it, so its url references resolve here as they do there.

Explicit data, from scenespec's fixtures/ (here without that prefix):
data/*.arrows, data/invalid/* and valid/explicit-data-0.6.json.
test/renderer.test.mjs reads them (part 12). The contract is the
"Explicit data: Arrow with GeoArrow geometry" section of scenespec's
README; scenespec's scripts/check-data.js is its reference checker.

Chunk references (scene spec 0.6), from scenespec's conformance/ (here in
conformance/): zarr-v2-chunks.json and its store tiny.zarr/ (a Zarr v2
array of zlib-compressed float32 chunks; chunk 1.2 is not stored).
test/renderer.test.mjs reads them (part 13). The rule is the "0.6: chunk
references" section of scenespec's README; scenespec's
scripts/check-refs.js is its reference decoder.

To update, copy the files again from a newer scenespec commit and change
the commit above.
